    {
      "text": "Better Long-Horizon Task Performance (Duration = 5 Minutes)",
      "section_id": "sec:preamble",
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "where ℒFW(ˆ𝑣, 𝑣) = ‖ˆ𝑣−𝑣‖2 is typically a mean squared error and 𝜂denotes the (learnable) learning rate. The",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑂𝑡= 𝑓𝑊𝑡(𝑄𝑡).",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "known as robot sequence models (22; 32; 56; 67). Concretely, a robot trajectory 𝜉= {(𝑜𝑡, 𝑞𝑡, 𝐴𝑡)}𝑇",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡=1 consists",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "learn policies 𝜋(𝐴𝑡|𝜉<𝑡, 𝑜𝑡, 𝑞𝑡) that condition on the history 𝜉<𝑡before timestep 𝑡and the current observation.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "For long-context policies, we aim to scale the context length |𝜉<𝑡|.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1 + H",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = T",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1 + H",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = T",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1+H",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "dicts an 𝐻-step action chunk 𝐴𝑡= [𝑎𝑡, . . . , 𝑎𝑡+𝐻−1]. We add TTT layers after the self- and cross-attention",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "then concatenated along the time dimension, 𝑋= [𝑅1, 𝑞1, ˜𝐴1, . . . , 𝑅𝑇, 𝑞𝑇, ˜𝐴𝑇], and passed through the TTT",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "layers directly for computational efficiency, relying instead on the smaller number (𝑁= 16) of register tokens",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 1 + H",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t = T",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "start of training. Concretely, for each DiT layer, we learn 𝛼∈R𝑑,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑂= tanh(𝛼) ⊙𝑂TTT + 𝑂attn,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Concretely, our dataset 𝒟= {𝜉(𝑖)}𝑁",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑖=1 contains 𝑁trajectories, each a sequence of language, image, pro-",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "prioception, and action-chunk tuples 𝜉= {(𝑙, 𝑜𝑡, 𝑞𝑡, 𝐴𝑡)}𝑇",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡=1, reintroducing the language instruction 𝑙, which",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "ℒfm (𝜉; 𝑊0) = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "learns to denoise ˜𝐴𝑡= 𝐴𝜏",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡= 𝜏𝐴𝑡+ (1 −𝜏)𝜖, where 𝜏∈[0, 1] is the flow-matching timestep and 𝜖∼𝒩(0, I)",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "To summarize, denoting the DiT action head as 𝑣𝜃and the timestep-𝑡tuple as 𝜉𝑡= (𝑙, 𝑜𝑡, 𝑞𝑡, 𝐴𝑡), we train",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "ℒfm (𝜉; 𝑊0) = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "ℓ𝑡(𝜉𝑡; 𝑊𝑡−1) = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "𝑡=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "where each 𝜏𝑡is sampled independently as 𝜏𝑡= 𝑠(1 −𝑢), 𝑢∼Beta(1.5, 1), 𝑠= 0.999.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 3,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "actions, yielding a trajectory 𝜉DAgger = {(𝑙, 𝑜𝑡, 𝑞𝑡, 𝐴𝑡)}𝑇",
